      "title": "單獨的 $\\arctan x$，接著換元",
      "prompt": "$\\int \\arctan x\\,dx$",
      "problemId": "exam-int-013",
      "steps": [
        "$u=\\arctan x$，$dv=dx$。$du=\\frac{dx}{1+x^2}$，$v=x$。",
        "$\\int \\arctan x\\,dx=x\\arctan x-\\int \\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx$。",
        "剩下的是 $\\frac{u'}{u}$ 形狀（〈換元：辨識〉）：$\\int \\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)$。",
        "答案：$x\\arctan x-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)+C$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$x\\arctan x-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)+C$",
      "claim": "D(x*atan(x)-ln(1+x^2)/2) == atan(x)"
    },
    {
      "title": "挑一個好用的 $v$",
      "prompt": "$\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx$",
      "problemId": "uni-int-012",
      "steps": [
        "$u=\\arctan x$，$dv=x\\,dx$。取 $v=\\frac{x^2+1}{2}$（也是 $x$ 的反導函數）。",
