        "剩下的積分是 $\\int \\frac{1}{2}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{2}$。",
        "答案：$\\frac{x^2+1}{2}\\arctan x-\\frac{x}{2}+C$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{x^2+1}{2}\\arctan x-\\frac{x}{2}+C$",
